title: veteran_adventurer
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands veteran>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "The Veteran Adventurer">>
You come across an adventurer resting by the roadside.
His equipment is worn from years of travel, yet carefully maintained.
Noticing your approach, he raises a hand in greeting.
Veteran: "Hey there! Taking a breather myself. What brings you this way?"
He sizes up your equipment, then flashes a friendly grin.
Veteran: "An adventurer too, eh? Or perhaps you're just trying to get by in this barren world..."
Veteran: "Whatever the case, fancy learning a thing or two? I've picked up a few tricks that might be beneficial to you."
-> Train endurance with him #paneldetails=Gain_2_Affinity._Add_Polish_Shield_to_your_deck._-5%_Health.
    <<change_affinity 2>><<change_health_percent -5>><<give_card YarnCommands "Polish Shield">>
    Veteran: "Endurance is what keeps you standing when everyone else falls apart. Come on, let's work on your posture."
    You spend some time training with the veteran, learning how to brace against incoming blows and mastering the fundamentals of defense, pushing through each exercise until your body aches.
    By the end, you feel exhausted, yet proud of the new profound skills you have acquired.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
-> Train strength with him #paneldetails=Gain_2_Affinity._-Add_Wind_Up_to_your_deck._-5%_Health.
    <<change_affinity 2>><<change_health_percent -5>><<give_card YarnCommands "Wind Up">>
    Veteran: "Proper technique is good, but a little strength goes a long way, too. Let's see what you can handle."
    You train together, learning how to put your whole body behind every strike to make every of them count.
    By the end, you feel exhausted, yet proud of the new profound skills you have acquired.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
-> Chat with him #paneldetails=Gain_1_Proficiency
    <<change_proficiency 1>>
    You sit down beside the veteran and exchange stories about your travels.
    Amidst the conversation, he shares some practical lessons learned from his years of hard-fought adventures.
    It's a surprisingly fruitful conversation. You leave with a better understanding of your own abilities.
